    "description": "Puzzler is a containerized, scalable command-line workflow for chromosome-scale de novo genome assembly from PacBio HiFi and Hi-C data, automating contig assembly, duplicate purging, Hi-C-based scaffolding, synteny-based chromosome assignment, and integrated QC, distributed via Conda and Apptainer/Singularity containers.",
